{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10644020","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10644020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1064402001:0":{"text":"夜の帳が北の大地を覆い、吹雪が唸り声を上げていた。サバス城内は暖かな灯に包まれ、領主の城館から笑い声と杯を打ち鳴らす音が漏れてくる。","source_cn":"夜幕笼罩北地，风雪呼号。安息城内温暖明亮，领主城堡方向...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2B45A4493DBE242","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064402002:0":{"text":"だが、やはりアルナは祝宴に加わってはいなかった。彼女はひとり城門の上に立ち、吹雪にかき乱される外の闇をじっと見据えていた。","source_cn":"阿尔娜没有参加为她而设的宴会，她立于城门，凝视城外受风...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3226C2907030C99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064402003:0":{"text":"将軍様、南方からさらに二組の流民が到着しました。彼らもまた、村を破壊した魔物が北へ進軍していると口を揃えております。","source_cn":"将军，又来了两批南方流民。他们都提到有屠戮村庄的魔物，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5021761BE9F360","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064402004:1":{"text":"それと……昨夜出発した三隊の斥候ですが、まだ音沙汰ありません。この吹雪では、もしかすると……","source_cn":"另外，昨天派出去的三队斥候，还没有任何音讯。风雪太大了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE856EC329E55DB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064402005:1":{"text":"吹雪だけが理由とは限らぬ。\n流民はすべて受け入れよ。先に命じた通り、食や防寒具の支給も忘れるな。","source_cn":"也许并非风雪。\\n接收流民，按此前的要求安置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2FB3AF2EAC7DB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064402006:1":{"text":"そして城門の兵を倍に。少しでも異変があれば、直ちに知らせよ。","source_cn":"向城门加派双倍人手，有任何异动，立刻示警。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BF72471BCFD6814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064402007:0":{"text":"吹雪がわずかに弱まったその刹那、雪原の彼方から、フードを深くかぶり、一本の杖を携えた人影が姿を現した。","source_cn":"风雪稍歇的间隙，一个戴着兜帽、手持法杖的身影自雪原中出现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x600F72629513EF58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064402008:0":{"text":"止まれ！何者だ！？","source_cn":"止步！何人？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x629599BC5035CB28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064402009:0":{"text":"私の名はマーリン、南方より参りましたメイジです。サバス城の存亡に関わる重大な知らせがありますので、どうか領主様にお取り次ぎください。","source_cn":"将军，我名为梅林，一名自南方而来的魔法师。请代为通报领...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D329348B2EA8DE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064402010:0":{"text":"あなたが疑われるのも無理はありません。しかし……南方でサバス兵たちの亡骸を見たと言えば、通していただけるでしょうか。","source_cn":"我知晓您此刻心存疑虑，但您派出的斥候，我在南方见到了他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFE1B90F0E38D1FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064402011:0":{"text":"お願いです。本格的な災厄が訪れる前に、今なら一縷の望みがあるかもしれません。","source_cn":"让我进城，或许能在灾厄降临前，筑起一线生机。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDB443E41F935B1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1064402012:0":{"text":"アルナは城外に佇むその影をじっと見据え、しばしの沈黙の後、彼女を営舎へ案内した。","source_cn":"阿尔娜审视城外平静的身影，片刻后，她将其带入营帐中","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03FA6970D96DAFF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064402013:0":{"text":"ありがとうございます、将軍……","source_cn":"感谢您的接见，将军……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x803ECB37E3786A49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064402014:1":{"text":"礼は要らぬ、知っていることを包み隠さず話せ。一言でも偽りがあれば、直ちにサバス城から追放する。","source_cn":"免去客套，直说你知晓的消息。记住，若有半分谎言，你将会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66BBB227D683C477","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064402015:1":{"text":"深淵に眠っていた意志が目覚めました。カタストロフは魔物の軍勢を率い、南方より北へ向け侵攻を開始しています。","source_cn":"源于深渊的意志已然苏醒，恶魔正驱策魔物大军，自南方向北席卷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A4EEEEE0E8AA822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064402016:1":{"text":"彼らは人間の武器はもちろん、北の寒さすらものともしません。その向かう先々に残るのは……命あるものが蹂躙された痕跡だけです。","source_cn":"它们不惧凡人的武器，不畏北地严寒，所过之处，生灵涂炭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x047E58AF6EE68131","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064402017:0":{"text":"何故、我はそなたの言葉を信じねばならぬ？\nただでさえ軍が逼迫した今、突如として素性も知れぬ者が現れたのだ。","source_cn":"我为何要相信你？\\n一个来历不明，在我军情紧急之时，突...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C04E173F77C8F6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064402018:0":{"text":"マーリンが呪文を詠唱すると、空中に魔物が人々を引き裂き、絶望がこだまする悪夢のような光景が映し出された。","source_cn":"梅林吟咏咒语，浮现出魔法影像：样貌扭曲的魔物轻易撕开人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFFE2C3DE88CCEB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064402019:1":{"text":"カソ城は魔物の吐く炎に焼かれ瓦礫と化し、メイカ町は凍りついた血痕に覆われ、バク村では……斥候隊がひとり残らず倒れていた。","source_cn":"卡索城的塔楼在魔物喷出的火焰中化为残垣，梅卡镇尽是冻结...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE77A8F524700A835","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064402020:0":{"text":"幾多の戦場をくぐり抜けてきたアルナでさえ、その歪んだ姿と純粋な悪意を前に、吹雪すら霞むほどの底知れぬ寒気を覚えた。","source_cn":"纵然阿尔娜饱经沙场，但那些扭曲的形态与纯粹的恶意，让她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC